[[63,7,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the access flap on the left side of\nthe rear bumper.</p><p>1. Undo the cap in an anti-clockwise direction and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065920.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the cap in a clockwise direction.</p><p>Close the access flap.</p>"]]